    "gp_section_566253351113589610": {
      "type": "gp-section-566253351113589610",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "d75ebc77b6972d1d4250ca935b3aded70e86709f6f7ec6e687b8fff826d49b87_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggpODz-G7zy_text": "<p>Still Not Sure?</p>",
        "ggTGHhyFr2y_text": "Here Are The Top Questions We Get About MenoMate",
        "ggRbssF9p-O_childItem_0": "<p>Product</p>",
        "ggRbssF9p-O_childItem_1": "<p>Shipping</p>",
        "ggRbssF9p-O_childItem_2": "<p>Others</p>",
        "ggRbssF9p-O_childItem_3": "<p>Reference</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_0": "<p>How do I use this product?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_1": "<p>What are the ingredients in this formula?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_2": "<p>Where is the formula produced?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_3": "<p>How does the formula taste?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_4": "<p>Can I use this with other products?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_5": "<p>Is this product vegan?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_6": "<p>What is the best time of day to take this product?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_7": "<p>Can I use this supplement if I am pregnant or breastfeeding?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_8": "<p>Can it be used by children?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_9": "<p>Where should I store this product?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_10": "<p>Are there any side effects?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_11": "<p>How long does one bottle last?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_12": "<p>Why choose this product over others?</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_13": "<p>Medical information, product reviews, warnings, and legal disclaimer</p>",
        "ggvBePF-YMH_childItem_14": "<p>Guarantee</p>",
        "ggq1EP9J19v_text": "<p>Simply take <strong>2 capsules</strong> daily with water. Most women notice improvements within the first 2 weeks, but everyone’s body is different—keep using MenoMate consistently for best results.</p>",
        "gg-g_qRBqJx_text": "<p>MenoMate features <strong>10 science-backed plant extracts and probiotics</strong> (including Turmeric, Black Cohosh, DIM, Moringa, and a Probiotic Blend) specifically chosen to tackle menopausal symptoms. Each ingredient is listed on our Supplement Facts panel for full transparency.</p>",
        "gg3yvU2Olx9_text": "<p>We produce MenoMate in an FDA-registered, GMP-certified facility in the U.S. to ensure <strong>quality and safety</strong> at every step.</p>",
        "ggy3FAXruH6_text": "<p>MenoMate comes in <strong>easy-to-swallow capsules</strong>—there’s no noticeable taste. If you’re sensitive, you can take them with juice, a smoothie, or simply water.</p>",
        "ggPyT_amn7A_text": "<p>Many women take MenoMate alongside a multivitamin or other supplements. However, if you have specific concerns or conditions, we always recommend consulting your healthcare provider first.</p>",
        "gggD8tpafmP_text": "<p>The plant extracts and probiotics are sourced from non-animal products, and we use <strong>veggie capsules</strong>. MenoMate is therefore <strong>vegan-friendly</strong>.</p>",
        "ggYc_Jkm0LX_text": "<p>Most women prefer taking their 2 capsules <strong>in the morning</strong>—but it’s flexible. Pick a consistent time of day that fits your routine.</p>",
        "ggIwyTfsYr__text": "<p>We advise speaking with your doctor before using MenoMate if you’re <strong>pregnant, planning to become pregnant, or breastfeeding</strong>.</p>",
        "ggGZuwsoafb_text": "<p>MenoMate is formulated for adult women dealing with menopausal or perimenopausal symptoms. If you have concerns about younger users, please consult a pediatrician.</p>",
        "ggoE61yf-7J_text": "<p>Keep MenoMate in a <strong>cool, dry place</strong>—preferably below 77°F (25°C). Avoid direct sunlight or extreme heat.</p>",
        "gggrUyv5dx-_text": "<p>MenoMate is generally well-tolerated. A small number of people may experience mild digestive upset or other minor symptoms. Discontinue use and consult your healthcare provider if you notice any adverse reactions.</p>",
        "ggwj1Aru2Ft_text": "<p>Each bottle contains 60 capsules—enough for <strong>30 days</strong> when taking 2 capsules per day.</p>",
        "ggq7KZaaCkT_text": "<p>MenoMate targets <strong>root hormonal imbalances</strong> with carefully measured, science-backed extracts (like Black Cohosh, DIM, and probiotics) that specifically address menopausal issues. We also offer a <strong>90-day money-back guarantee,</strong> so you can try it risk-free.</p>",
        "ggcOHg4itCG_text": "<p>The statements on our website haven’t been evaluated by the FDA. MenoMate is <strong>not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease</strong>. Always consult a healthcare professional for personalized medical advice.</p>",
        "ggRCc7G6bya_text": "<p>MenoMate is protected by our <strong>90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you don’t see or feel a difference in your menopausal symptoms, reach out within 90 days for a <strong>full refund—no questions asked</strong>.</p>",
        "gglcdmkd8da_childItem_0": "<p>Is my credit card information secure?</p>",
        "gglcdmkd8da_childItem_1": "<p>Where do you ship?</p>",
        "gglcdmkd8da_childItem_2": "<p>How much does shipping cost?</p>",
        "gglcdmkd8da_childItem_3": "<p>How do I track my package?</p>",
        "gglcdmkd8da_childItem_4": "<p>I didn’t receive a shipping or order confirmation. Help!</p>",
        "ggm69qGseZP_text": "<p>Yes, all credit card transactions are securely processed through Shopify, PayPal, or Amazon.</p>",
        "ggVMxdMDuY2_text": "<p>We offer free shipping worldwide! No matter where you are, your order will be delivered to you at no extra cost.</p>",
        "gg1rq9Olj6J_text": "<p>Shipping is free for all orders!</p>",
        "ggsN1U-GCY8_text": "<p>Tracking information should have been sent to you via email when you placed your order. If you didn’t receive it, send us an email at support@wellnessnest.co.</p>",
        "ggPVPr2coyV_text": "<p>No worries! Email us at support@wellnessnest.co, and we’ll sort it out for you.</p>",
        "gg6WF8ri_EG_childItem_0": "<p>Are Wellness Nest supplements FDA-approved?</p>",
        "gg6WF8ri_EG_childItem_1": "<p>Are there any artificial flavors, colors, or dyes in Wellness Nest supplements?</p>",
        "gg6WF8ri_EG_childItem_2": "<p>Where are Wellness Nest supplements manufactured?</p>",
        "ggnx-cJU3Y-_text": "<p>By law, the FDA does not approve dietary supplements. However, it does regulate both dietary supplements and their ingredients. At Wellness Nest, we comply with the FDA’s “Current Good Manufacturing Practice” (cGMP) regulations, established in 2007. These require manufacturers to evaluate products for identity, purity, strength, and composition. We go further by testing for stability with our manufacturers and conducting third-party testing for potency of active ingredients, as well as screening for adulterants like heavy metals and microbes, allergens, rancidity, and other unwanted contaminants.</p>",
        "ggOEfqGE9-A_text": "<p>Nope! Our capsules are all-natural, made with vegan, non-GMO, and gluten-free ingredients.</p>",
        "ggNWUS-d4fm_text": "<p>Wellness Nest supplements are formulated, manufactured, and<strong> packaged with care right here in the USA</strong>. That said, some of our products may occasionally be backstocked from third-party manufacturers partnering with our main supplier, based in India, China, or Vietnam.</p>",
        "gg2Lh4xW-V-_text": "<p><strong>1. Johns Hopkins Medicine</strong>: https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/health/wellness-and-prevention/turmeric-benefits</p><p><strong>2. Idyl</strong>: https://www.idyl.co.in/blogs/blog/unlock-the-heart-healthy-secrets-of-curry-leaves</p><p><strong>3. Journal of Midwifery &amp; Women's Health</strong>: https://journals.lww.com/jomh/fulltext/2024/15010/exploring_the_efficacy_and_safety_of_black_cohosh.3.aspx</p><p><strong>4. PMC</strong>: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9881416/</p><p><strong>5. PubMed</strong>: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16552838/</p><p><strong>6. Medical News Today</strong>: https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/317530</p><p><strong>7. Harvard Health Publishing</strong>: https://www.health.harvard.edu/staying-healthy/turmeric-benefits-a-look-at-the-evidence</p><p><strong>8. NDTV</strong>: https://www.ndtv.com/food/diabetes-how-curry-leaves-kadi-patta-help-manage-blood-sugar-levels-1949847</p><p><strong>9. NIH</strong>: https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/BlackCohosh-HealthProfessional/</p><p><strong>10. WebMD</strong>: https://www.webmd.com/vitamins/ai/ingredientmono-662/turmeric</p><p><strong>11. Healthline</strong>: https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/curry-leaves-benefits</p><p><strong>12. Mount Sinai</strong>: https://www.mountsinai.org/health-library/herb/black-cohosh</p><p><strong>13. Mayo Clinic</strong>: https://newsnetwork.mayoclinic.org/discussion/mayo-clinic-minute-are-there-health-benefits-to-taking-turmeric/</p><p><strong>14. Healthline</strong>: https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/top-10-evidence-based-health-benefits-of-turmeric</p>",
        "gg-5SAf945I_background_desktop_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-58b4d128-8ffd-4b66-88b6-098822aa2870.png",
        "gg-5SAf945I_background_tablet_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-457d5084-1e5d-471b-a6a5-f20fa954a27f.png",
