        "gUAgLNqbwstvV_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#772B90;\"><strong>MenoMate</strong></span> helps you tackle the root hormonal imbalances so you can:</p>",
        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_0": "<p><strong>Ease Joint Pain and Stiffness</strong><br>Move without wincing—rediscover the joy of walking, bending, and stretching comfortably.</p>",
