        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Enjoy Your Favorite Activities&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Whether it’s gardening, yoga, or playing with grandkids, do it all without joint aches holding you back.</p>",
        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_4": "<p><strong>Boost Your Mood and Energy&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Bypass irritability and fatigue—feel calm, balanced, and energized all day.</p>",
