        "gmHnbQgXTCXiW_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#F582AE;\"><strong>Start Moving Like Yourself Again—Whether You’re In Perimenopause, Menopause, Or Post-Menopause.</strong></span> With MenoMate, you can reclaim your mobility, comfort, and spark—naturally.</p>",
