        "gPPJjadZSBKcL_text": "<p>By targeting the hormonal imbalances that inflame your joints, MenoMate helps you <strong>feel relief—fast</strong>. Don’t let menopause steal your freedom. Reclaim your movement, your confidence, and your spark with just <span style=\"color:#F582AE;\"><strong>2 capsules a day.</strong></span></p>",
