    "gp_section_566253351114834794": {
      "type": "gp-section-566253351114834794",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "ef77b3e01ef275596d6c90108f59e99ad129e62f4aa9df78007baf461014ca52_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_desktop_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-3a6c509e-a534-45ca-a491-aed3d3ea1bda.png",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_tablet_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-3a6c509e-a534-45ca-a491-aed3d3ea1bda.png",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_mobile_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-9581e136-ad75-4e9d-a5fd-9dd3c24ec4cd.png",
        "gszYGqLzOBmUe_text": "<p>Over <span style=\"color:#9128B4;\">682,700+</span> Women Are Experiencing Joint Pain Relief With MenoMate</p>",
        "gOYLtzXPaWRMh_text": "<p>Listen to how real women have transformed their daily experience - from dreading simple movements to embracing life's activities again.</p>",
        "ggZQufQFeRM_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Screenshot_2025-05-01_at_14.53.42.webp?v=1746086109",
        "ggZQufQFeRM_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Screenshot_2025-05-01_at_14.53.42.webp?v=1746086109",
        "gkzvDKVxbbZMn_text": "<p>\"For months, I dreaded getting out of bed—the morning stiffness in my hips made every step a challenge. After 17 days with MenoMate, I noticed something remarkable: I was walking my dog without that stabbing pain shooting down my leg. My hips feel supported, and I've stopped grimacing when I stand up from chairs.\"</p>",
        "gzoNOfWvxkEJP_text": "<p>Maria T.</p>",
        "ggpTXsDpIcJ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-fcd58a58-2a44-4db3-b17b-ae085edee9d0.png",
        "gdibeONFxMzze_text": "Verified buyer",
        "ggA2JptTANX_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/selfie_3_Large_1f44d359-aa89-41cf-9f33-935eb1bf79a8.jpg?v=1748488681",
        "giPpISqNpXyua_text": "<p>\"I tried everything for my aching hands and knees—heat packs, over-the-counter pills, even expensive injections. Nothing provided lasting relief until MenoMate. Within three weeks, I could garden again without that nagging stiffness. I'm back to being myself, not just 'the woman who can't move comfortably.\"</p>",
        "ggOCh3t-eUS_text": "<p>Kimberly L.</p>",
        "ggVz7hxKNzx_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-fcd58a58-2a44-4db3-b17b-ae085edee9d0.png",
        "gg2LGafJcso_text": "Verified buyer",
        "ggbYScVLDFY_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/IMG_8676_Large_e9dc07a9-f1cd-4fd8-83ba-5c8361cad7e0.jpg?v=1748488681",
        "gTSVppQVRPihz_text": "<p><i>\"The tendonitis in my elbow had me at my wit's end—I couldn't even lift a coffee cup without wincing. Two weeks after starting MenoMate, I realized I was reaching for things without hesitation. The difference is night and day. I've even lost 4 pounds without changing anything else. Just remember to stay consistent with the dosage—it makes all the difference.\"</i></p>",
        "ggQD1otzcjp_text": "<p>Lisa S.</p>",
        "ggFAycpWMJi_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-fcd58a58-2a44-4db3-b17b-ae085edee9d0.png",
        "ggBfSRtuE_b_text": "Verified buyer",
        "ggr_5oZrrOQ_label": "<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>",
        "gwpdmMKsubLaI_text": "<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>",
        "gpubOZkHVclLg_text": "<p>The most misunderstood menopause symptoms is <span style=\"color:#A11CAD;\">Joint Discomfort</span></p>",
        "gfiDlVIjRNdxJ_text": "<p>Why Joint Pain After 40 Is The #1 Frustration For Women</p>",
        "gjutyetiERQwe_text": "<p>The Truth About Menopausal Joint Discomfort Your Doctor Might Have Missed</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That sudden stiffness when you stand up. The tender knees that make stairs your enemy. The wrists that ache when you type or garden.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This isn't simply \"getting older\"—it's your body's response to a dramatic hormonal shift that begins as early as your late 30s.</p>",
        "gQzmPPxstfQnQ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggApJBF4RRB_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/estrogen.png?v=1743587112",
        "ggDV0xM_XuD_text": "<p><strong>Estrogen Decline</strong></p>",
        "gg9nfKCihSv_text": "<p><strong>Joint Drought</strong></p>",
        "gg1YF_5oFKR_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gg1YF_5oFKR_srcSet_tablet_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/root1.png?v=1743505201",
        "gg1YF_5oFKR_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/root1.png?v=1743505201",
        "ggdUif0QzM__text": "<p>When estrogen levels drop, your joints lose critical lubrication and flexibility, creating friction where smooth movement once existed.</p>",
        "ggDJ-QYZvy-_text": "<p><strong>Hormone-Triggered Inflammation</strong></p>",
        "ggHbK5QaWb1_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggHbK5QaWb1_srcSet_tablet_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/root2.png?v=1743505201",
        "ggHbK5QaWb1_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/root2.png?v=1743505201",
        "ggmzcmBPlhJ_text": "<p>&nbsp;Fluctuating hormones trigger systemic inflammation that specifically targets joint tissue, creating persistent discomfort that ordinary approaches can't touch.</p>",
        "ggTsBAmMsSo_text": "<p><strong>Metabolic Changes Stress Your Joints</strong></p>",
        "ggYhxHjK-h__srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggYhxHjK-h__srcSet_tablet_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/root3.png?v=1743505201",
        "ggYhxHjK-h__srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/root3.png?v=1743505201",
        "ggLytWEtUsB_text": "<p>&nbsp;Hormonal shifts redirect weight distribution, placing new pressure on joints while simultaneously reducing your body's natural repair mechanisms.</p>",
        "gBRefzwPsvJwl_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#503ACC;\"><strong>That's why</strong></span> traditional joint supplements, endless stretching, and even rest periods leave you frustrated.&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggsxSGi-ZMs_text": "<p>They're not addressing the hormonal root cause.</p>",
        "gg6oVysJJxT_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#F582AE;\"><strong>The good news?</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When you finally target the hormonal imbalance behind your joint discomfort, your body can rebuild comfort and mobility from within.</p>"
      }
    },
