        "ggMCdlRsFzM_text": "<p>We use a <strong>256-bit secure checkout </strong>your data is encrypted, safe, and secure.</p>",
        "gg1dnphnN_p_text": "Your Purchase Is Protected By Our <span style=\"color:#503ACC;\">90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</span>",
        "ggKluQ6zldi_text": "<p>Here at Wellness Nest, we want you to feel absolutely confident trying our product—or we’ll refund 100% of your investment. We’re so certain you’ll see a real change in your menopause symptoms, hot flashes, mood, and weight management that we bear all the risk.</p>",
        "ggLHL2V3cb4_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/joint.png?v=1743507442",
        "ggLHL2V3cb4_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/joint.png?v=1743507442",
        "ggTkT2oDw61_text": "<p>Most women see improvements in 14 days</p>",
        "gghwnumyYLO_text": "<p>Most women notice improvements within 14 days—moving more freely, tackling daily tasks with less pain, and sleeping better without that nagging ache. Some feel relief faster, some take a bit longer—everyone’s different. If you don’t feel more comfortable, active, or notice better mobility in your first 90 days, just let us know and we’ll process your instant refund, no questions asked.</p>",
        "gg-jNqc7m3E_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Frame_1948755524.png?v=1741863840",
        "ggR8Nfr8nSz_text": "<p>Free Shipping&nbsp;</p><p>On All Orders</p>",
        "ggkAy6Z4oKG_text": "<p>We believe in saving you extra hassle. That’s why any purchase of two bottles or more receives free shipping—because you shouldn’t have to pay hidden fees to reclaim your comfort and confidence. The more you buy, the more you save!</p>",
        "ggKXNvjMz_U_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Frame_1948755524-1.png?v=1741863840",
        "ggU_VQh8jl2_text": "<p>90-Day Money Back Guarantee&nbsp;&amp; Instant Refunds</p>",
        "ggPHlh6tosL_text": "<p>With <strong>up to three full months</strong> to experience MenoMate, you’ll have plenty of time to see real improvements—from fewer hot flashes and better sleep to a flatter midsection. If you’re not completely satisfied, just reach out for a<strong> fast, no-questions-asked refund</strong>. We want your only surprise to be how quickly you feel like yourself again.</p>"
      }
