    "gp_section_574758285266126053": {
      "type": "gp-section-574758285266126053",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "19f9cbd60970f75a29df6afac0e0648de45759b2e75450a7df5f44219634374d_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggOMaYRCDaX_text": "OUR MISSION &amp; TEAM",
        "ggO7IzwbSC3_text": "<p>We Aim To Help 1 Billion Women Conquer Menopause—So They Can Finally Feel Like Themselves Again</p>",
        "ggKTdwASU5O_childItem_0": "Tab 1",
        "ggKTdwASU5O_childItem_1": "Tab 2",
        "ggKTdwASU5O_childItem_2": "Tab 3",
        "ggKTdwASU5O_childItem_3": "Tab 4",
        "ggeRUEJM04i_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggEdNsHQb9-_text": "Dr. Claire Thompson",
        "gg9XAMKeCrH_text": "ND- Women's Hormone Expert",
        "ggyKzIx6Woy_text": "<p>With 15 years of clinical practice focusing on hormonal impacts on connective tissue, Dr. Claire identified the root causes of menopausal joint discomfort that led to MenoMate's breakthrough formula. \"When I discovered the direct link between estrogen decline and tendon degradation, I knew we needed a solution that addressed this root cause rather than just masking symptoms.</p>",
        "gg4VL1LaYri_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gg0Do6bThsX_text": "<p>Rachel Nguyen</p>",
        "ggBxMQOVF0u_text": "<p>BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist</p>",
        "gguPXBSuiR8_text": "<p>Rachel leverages her extensive knowledge of bioactive plant compounds to optimize every component in MenoMate. \"Through rigorous clinical testing, we've ensured each ingredient delivers measurable improvements in tendon resilience and joint comfort—without resorting to synthetic compounds or short-term fixes.</p>",
        "ggdYQoR5hY__srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggrQNJtt2wv_text": "<p>Elizabeth Ross</p>",
        "gg-QH35cJgW_text": "<p>OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health</p>",
        "ggUvlr3vOgd_text": "<p>Dr. Ross applies decades of clinical experience to fine-tune MenoMate's synergistic blend. \"I've witnessed firsthand how critical natural tendon support becomes during hormonal transitions, especially for maintaining comfortable side-sleeping and daily mobility.</p>",
        "ggKeEFqfHqY_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggRGYQVqWOR_text": "<p>Kevin</p>",
        "ggWaNGBtfJJ_text": "<p>Founder &amp; Biohacking Enthusiast</p>",
        "ggE2t-jp6P-_text": "<p>Motivated by his wife's struggle with debilitating hip pain, Kevin committed to finding natural, research-backed alternatives. \"Watching my wife unable to sleep comfortably for months was heartbreaking. Creating MenoMate became my personal mission—helping women maintain their active lifestyles throughout menopause.</p>",
        "ggduIgzsZ0i_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggQQPrBunlO_text": "<p>Dr. Claire Thompson</p>",
        "gg1omxLChOb_text": "<p>ND- Women's Hormone Expert</p>",
        "ggrZpeVzyFI_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggrmJlXdC1F_text": "Rachel Nguyen",
        "ggGxeJisgy5_text": "BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist",
        "ggBRDKkOdid_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggpVHDeeO9d_text": "Elizabeth Ross",
        "gg0qq8rvr8I_text": "OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health",
        "ggoZ6uQZKgp_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gg2nOY7Foy4_text": "<p>Kevin</p>",
        "ggGuRZs59DR_text": "Founder & Biohacking Enthusiast",
        "ggVV7uRGN0v_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggOTUwYPYjD_text": "Dr. Claire Thompson",
        "ggz8HlcYK5D_text": "ND- Women's Hormone Expert",
        "ggGFl73QBEq_text": "<p>With 15 years of clinical practice focusing on hormonal impacts on connective tissue, Dr. Claire identified the root causes of menopausal joint discomfort that led to MenoMate's breakthrough formula. \"When I discovered the direct link between estrogen decline and tendon degradation, I knew we needed a solution that addressed this root cause rather than just masking symptoms.</p>",
        "ggDV8iXfwdg_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggwxdHMJGKI_text": "Rachel Nguyen",
        "gg8AqOA9Mz8_text": "BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist",
        "ggBm94w-u-E_text": "<p>Rachel leverages her extensive knowledge of bioactive plant compounds to optimize every component in MenoMate. \"Through rigorous clinical testing, we've ensured each ingredient delivers measurable improvements in tendon resilience and joint comfort—without resorting to synthetic compounds or short-term fixes.\"</p>",
        "ggwf_3sfYkD_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gg5T52dYa2q_text": "Elizabeth Ross",
        "ggvX3WCm454_text": "OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health",
        "ggESLrYV_yJ_text": "<p>Dr. Ross applies decades of clinical experience to fine-tune MenoMate's synergistic blend. \"I've witnessed firsthand how critical natural tendon support becomes during hormonal transitions, especially for maintaining comfortable side-sleeping and daily mobility.</p>",
        "ggfzwacnDMU_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggWJ9X9kOXK_text": "<p>Kevin Miller</p>",
        "gg3NKg_9xK-_text": "Founder & Biohacking Enthusiast",
        "ggV_n9eIBa2_text": "<p>Motivated by his wife's struggle with debilitating hip pain, Kevin committed to finding natural, research-backed alternatives. \"Watching my wife unable to sleep comfortably for months was heartbreaking. Creating MenoMate became my personal mission—helping women maintain their active lifestyles throughout menopause.</p>",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_desktop_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-3ffa59ed-03ea-47a1-b3e6-f732ee8eca16.png",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_desktop_video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cyzh48XRS4M",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_desktop_videoHtml5": "https://media.w3.org/2010/05/sintel/trailer.mp4",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_tablet_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-3ffa59ed-03ea-47a1-b3e6-f732ee8eca16.png",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_tablet_video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cyzh48XRS4M",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_tablet_videoHtml5": "https://media.w3.org/2010/05/sintel/trailer.mp4",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_mobile_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-1f753ce9-f5f5-46a6-a6f3-908ce667355b.png",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_mobile_video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cyzh48XRS4M",
        "ggjQfiAC0Tk_background_mobile_videoHtml5": "https://media.w3.org/2010/05/sintel/trailer.mp4",
        "ggY04e2mXM__text": "<p>Together, our diverse expertise blends into<strong> one mission</strong>: to give you real,<strong> life-changing relief</strong> from menopause so you can reclaim your comfort, confidence, and joy every single day.</p>"
      }
    }
